# Beyond Infinity (jeuno 137): the Limit Breaker not held. A level 91 Warrior at level cap 95, Prelude to Puissance
# completed, no Limit Breaker, no Soul Gem Clasp, MAX_LEVEL 99, rejectedStartLB10 1 (a GM): limitBreaker 2, so the
# MAX_LEVEL / key / level test fails: 10045 (91, 2, 0, 0, 0) (the local var not read). Option 14: begun and set down at
# Horlais Peak; with no clasp held, state 4's finish runs in the same lookup (the status read afresh): option 14 is not
# 0, so the clasp is given (14 is none of 17 / 25 / 26 / 27: no second set-down). In Horlais Peak: the clasp held.
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10045
warning: quests: jeuno.beyond_infinity: one finish of 10045 ran 2 handlers (1/-/onEventFinish:10045, 4/-/onEventFinish:10045) -- the Lua runs it twice too: its sections at LB10_Beyond_Infinity.lua:77 (available), :135 (accepted) and :207 (accepted, Prog 0, no Soul Gem Clasp) at lua-at d8964eb5 hold the finish, and the lookup reads each check after the earlier handlers ran, so the first's status change lets the second match
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=11.5,2.5,121.9 job=WAR lvl=91
levelcap 95
quest Jeuno.PreludeToPuissance completed
login
localvar rejectedStartLB10 1            # a GM
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # no Limit Breaker: 10045 (91, 2, 0, 0, 0)
finish option=14                        # begun; set down at Horlais Peak; state 4 (no clasp): the Soul Gem Clasp
tick 400                                # the zone change runs at the tick
login                                   # in Horlais Peak, the clasp held
